e computers solving problems. They store everything you ever do online from birth to death. Why do you think there's so many? Anyone supporting this shit needs to be shot in the head. This lie about not letting China win the race is for you patriotic simpleton to get you all worked up. The rest of the work isn't even building thousands of gigantic data centers. Fight this bullshit surveillance state. ", "author": "ImprerialWalker", "created": 1788212261201, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "sumnayin2", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Data centers are data storage centers not computing centers solving problems", "last_comment_created": 1788218020524, "content": "<p>They are lying to you about them being needed to cure cancer and solve the energy crisis. They store data and that's all. They are not computing centers with mainframe computers solving problems. They store everything you ever do online from birth to death. Why do you think there's so many? Anyone supporting this shit needs to be shot in the head. This lie about not letting China win the race is for you patriotic simpleton to get you all worked up. The rest of the work isn't even building thousands of gigantic data centers. Fight this bullshit surveillance state.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 18, "score_up": 32, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}